    ":question/problem": "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/generate/scratch/17592186105904/plots/dce1fbcf76bce1a3f7989e62de27a8c997af2439a7f1e8ee299041890ca70719.png)\n\nThe area of the triangle $\u25b3ABC$ is $\\frac{35\\sqrt{2}}{4}\\,\\text{cm}^{2}.$ Find $AC.$",
